The code does not take into account memory usage optimization since it is assumed that a ConcurrentHashMap is memory efficient for this use case. If necessary, more advanced data structures like Bloom filters or compressed arrays could be used instead. Additionally, error handling and retry mechanisms can be further optimized to minimize the impact on system performance and reliability by implementing techniques such as bulkhead isolation or circuit breakers.']

