The cache has features like periodically expiring connections based on their last activity timestamp (`cache_expire()`) and checking the system's memory usage and closing unused connections when necessary (`cache_check_memory()`). Additionally, it uses a LRU cache management system that evicts the least recently used connections when necessary.']

