The implementation uses a ConcurrentHashMap as the LRU cache with a maximum capacity of 5,000 entries and a Time-to-Live (TTL) of 1 hour. It also implements a simple dynamic buffer similar to a C function using an int array for managing memory allocation. The method evenSum() handles null or empty lists gracefully, calculates the sum of all even numbers in the input list, utilizes a custom serialization mechanism when necessary, and supports logging errors with retry logic for logging failures.

Unit tests are not provided in this response but can be added as needed to test various input conditions, including edge cases.']

