To further enhance concurrency, consider using an efficient data structure like Boost.Asio's `io_service` or other libraries that provide high-performance concurrent data structures optimized for your specific use case. Additionally, you may want to use finer-grained locks (e.g., locking only the portions of the vector being accessed) to minimize contention and improve performance in high-concurrency environments."]

